WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.299
Guide five: reading the script, and

2
00:00:02.299 --> 00:00:03.820
the Change button.

3
00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:06.342
Open the Videos tab and click a

4
00:00:06.342 --> 00:00:08.223
video. Each step has its own tab

5
00:00:08.223 --> 00:00:09.607
along this row.

6
00:00:10.207 --> 00:00:11.847
Click Script. Here's the whole

7
00:00:11.847 --> 00:00:13.593
script, written for your channel's

8
00:00:13.593 --> 00:00:15.236
format. Read it the way a viewer

9
00:00:15.236 --> 00:00:16.413
would hear it.

10
00:00:17.013 --> 00:00:18.784
Open folder shows every file this

11
00:00:18.784 --> 00:00:20.455
video is made from, right on your

12
00:00:20.455 --> 00:00:21.364
computer.

13
00:00:21.964 --> 00:00:23.418
Want something different?

14
00:00:23.418 --> 00:00:24.879
Click Change the script.

15
00:00:25.479 --> 00:00:27.427
Say what's wrong in plain words.

16
00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:28.837
For example: make the opening

17
00:00:28.837 --> 00:00:30.300
shorter and punchier.

18
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:32.719
Click Send to my assistant.

19
00:00:32.719 --> 00:00:34.595
It rewrites the script the next time

20
00:00:34.595 --> 00:00:36.314
you say go, and remakes the steps

21
00:00:36.314 --> 00:00:37.356
built from it.

22
00:00:37.356 --> 00:00:39.075
Anything paid asks your yes first

23
00:00:39.075 --> 00:00:40.319
with the price.

24
00:00:40.919 --> 00:00:42.755
The Script tab now says Change

25
00:00:42.755 --> 00:00:44.781
asked. Next time you say go to your

26
00:00:44.781 --> 00:00:47.073
assistant, it makes the change.

27
00:00:47.673 --> 00:00:49.335
Every part you can remake has a

28
00:00:49.335 --> 00:00:50.898
Change button like this one:

29
00:00:50.898 --> 00:00:52.359
the thumbnail, the voice, one

30
00:00:52.359 --> 00:00:53.720
picture or all of them, the

31
00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.484
captions, the music, the title, and

32
00:00:55.484 --> 00:00:56.491
the Shorts.

33
00:00:57.091 --> 00:00:58.383
Changed your mind?

34
00:00:58.383 --> 00:00:59.526
Tell your assistant:

35
00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:00.569
change my mind.

36
00:01:00.569 --> 00:01:02.307
It goes back a step, and nothing is

37
00:01:02.307 --> 00:01:03.401
ever deleted.

38
00:01:04.001 --> 00:01:06.681
Next: your finished video.
